<!--
    The vertical three-dot "more options" glyph, on the right of each care routine card.

    This is the platform's established sign for "there are more actions hidden here", so users open
    it without having to be told — which is what lets the card show only the routine's name,
    schedule and count while still offering edit, pause and delete.

    Tinted by the button that shows it, so the white fill here never appears on screen.
-->
